No source code or animation constant is copied from that project; the
implementation here is written against Reanimated 4, react-native-gesture-handler
and the New Architecture. The API surface is reproduced deliberately, for
compatibility.

rn-zoom is an independent community rewrite. It is not affiliated with, nor
endorsed by, the authors of react-native-lightbox.
